00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Squall, the protagonist, moves through the chaos with singular purpose. His blue SeeD uniform stands out among the confusion. He wields his gunblade with practiced efficiency, cutting through Galbadian soldiers who attempt to block his path.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Explosions erupt around Squall as he advances. He doesn't hesitate or slow, leaping over collapsed sections, vaulting barriers, and pushing deeper into contested territory. His determination is evident in every movement.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Squall battles through a corridor of Galbadian defenders. Multiple soldiers attack simultaneously. His gunblade clashes with their weapons. He dispatches them with superior combat skill, moving ever forward toward Galbadia Garden.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Squall reaches a connecting point between the two Gardens where they are locked together. He boards Galbadia Garden, leaving behind the chaos of Balamb's defense. His destination is clear — he must confront Edea and stop this invasion personally.